Package: importABCatlas
Title: Import Allen Brain Cell Atlas Data into R as Seurat Objects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Uday", "Rangaswamy",  role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "uday.rangaswamy@ieo.it"),
    person("Federico", "Caretti", role = c("aut")))
Description: Provides an R-native interface to the Allen Brain Cell (ABC) Atlas.
    Downloads release manifests and data files from the public ABC Atlas S3
    bucket, assembles cell metadata for supported datasets (whole human brain,
    whole mouse brain, aging mouse, and others) and fetches gene expression for
    filtered cell populations as sparse 'Seurat' objects. Everything runs in R:
    no Python installation is required.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
